Domain Entity StudentAssessmentRegistration
    documentation "Identifies an assessment registration that a student is expected to participate in including the testing organization, reporting organization and assessment delivery details."
    domain entity AssessmentAdministration
        documentation "A reference to the expected administration of an assessment."
        is part of identity
    association StudentEducationOrganizationAssociation
        documentation "A reference to the attending student education organization association."
        is part of identity
    association StudentSchoolAssociation
        documentation "Identifies an assessment registration that a student is expected to participate in including the testing organization, reporting organization and assessment delivery details."
        is required
        merge StudentSchoolAssociation.Student with StudentEducationOrganizationAssociation.Student
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation "A reference to the education organization expected to administer the assessment."
        is optional
        role name Testing
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation "A reference to the education organization which should receive the results of the assessment."
        is optional
        role name Reporting
    domain entity StudentEducationOrganizationAssessmentAccommodation
        documentation "A reference to the accommodations expected for administering the assessment."
        is optional
        merge StudentEducationOrganizationAssessmentAccommodation.Student with StudentSchoolAssociation.Student
        merge StudentEducationOrganizationAssessmentAccommodation.Student with StudentEducationOrganizationAssociation.Student
    descriptor Accommodation
        documentation "The special variation(s) to be used in how assessments (in general) are presented, how it is administered, or how the test taker is allowed to respond. This generally refers to changes that do not substantially alter what the examination measures. The proper use of accommodations does not substantially change academic level or performance criteria."
        is optional collection
        role name Assessment
    descriptor PlatformType
        documentation "The environment or format in which the assessment is expected to be administered."
        is optional
    descriptor GradeLevel
        documentation "The grade level or primary instructional level at which the student is to be assessed."
        is optional
        role name Assessment
    common AssessmentCustomization
        documentation "Key/value pairs which may be used to facilitate customization of an assessment or to support vendor reporting/analysis."
        is optional collection